message.content:
Fix three components in this Next.js marketing site at /Users/yashbaldha/Desktop/Boldteq App/Marketing Site/Boldteq:

## Fix 1: Blog Grid Section — Add border-radius and background color

**File:** src/components/blog/blog-grid.module.css

Current `.section`:
```css
.section {
  background-color: #f5f7fa;
  padding: 64px 5% 80px;
}
```

Change to match Webflow `.blog-post-sec`:
```css
.section {
  background-color: #ecf7fd;
  border-bottom-right-radius: 80px;
  border-bottom-left-radius: 80px;
  padding: 0 3% 80px;
  display: block;
  position: relative;
}
```

Note: The padding-top changes from 64px to 0. This is because in the Webflow structure, the blog hero is separate and provides the top spacing. The blog-post-sec section sits directly below the hero.

## Fix 2: Blog Hero — Make transparent (uses body-gradient-image)

**File:** src/components/blog/blog-hero.module.css

Current `.section`:
```css
.section {
  background-color: #092245;
  padding: 80px 5% 72px;
  text-align: center;
}
```

Change to match Webflow `.blog-page-banner`:
```css
.section {
  background-color: transparent;
  padding-top: 4rem;
  padding-bottom: 4rem;
  text-align: center;
  font-weight: 400;
  text-decoration: none;
}
```

Also update the heading and subtitle text colors in blog-hero.module.css since background is now transparent (will be light due to body-gradient-image):
- `.heading`: change from `color: #ffffff` to `color: #082753`
- `.subtitle`: change from `color: rgba(255,255,255,0.65)` to `color: #5b616e`
- `.badge`: change from `background-color: rgba(255,255,255,0.08)` to `background-color: rgba(33,207,255,0.1)`, border change from `rgba(255,255,255,0.14)` to `#05bafe40`
- `.badgeLabel`: change from `color: #ffffff` to `color: #082753`
- `.badgeIcon`: remove `filter: brightness(0) invert(1)` (icon should show normal color)
- `.cta`: keep gradient styling as-is (it's still a gradient button)

Also in blog-hero.tsx: Check if the "Explore How It Works" link still makes sense visually.

## Fix 3: Portfolio Grid Section — Change to transparent background

**File:** src/components/our-works/portfolio-grid.module.css

Current `.section`:
```css
.section {
  background-color: #f5f7fa;
  padding: 20px 5% 40px;
}
```

Change to match Webflow `.work-tab-sec.new`:
```css
.section {
  background-color: transparent;
  padding: 20px 5% 60px;
  display: block;
}
```

Read all files before editing them. Make only the specific changes described — do not change any other CSS values, component logic, or structure.

